Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll skip it. When I\Nfall the road, but think.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that, I'm so proud\Nto be. I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll follow me. I'll try out more.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.24,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a new factory. I'm going to say
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.22,0:02:00.89,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx150\fscy150\pos(316,345)}Dagomon's Call
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what you got in question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on guys, you heard the principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to scrape gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last one in has to eat the old gum
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,School? Wow, looks like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think Kari's having\Nfun inside of school or out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hasn't been sleeping well\Nbecause of her bad dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't tell me what they're about,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she wakes up every morning\Ndripping in a cold sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she sense something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:02:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just imagining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go read the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, as you can\Nsee, x equals y, y equals 14,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and lickety-split q equals 36.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, isn't that exciting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, boring paint drying or math?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder why Kari's being so distant today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I just over tired from not sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get these dreams out of my head
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know my math scores have been a little\Nfoggy lately, but this is ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bizarre
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did someone flood\Nthe boys' bathroom again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.74,0:04:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.18,0:04:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go to the nurse's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's definitely wrong with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blame it on the algebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so boring, you fell asleep\Nand dreamed you were in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I let you down, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is anybody there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win, Davis. I'm scared now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I have your attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will the student who\Nput the jelly donuts in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the swimming pool please\Nreport to the office?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I see Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but Kari's\Nnot here, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a lollipop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.72,0:05:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to lie down, TK? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's in the girl's bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, she's not in the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, are you down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like she just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, do I have a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I threw the jelly\Ndoughnuts to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, I've been looking all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? It was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was at the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beach in another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw me in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just sitting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then the next thing I\Nknew, I was in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've totally lost me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, on my way to the nurse's office, it\Nhappened again I was surrounded by water,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw one of them What\Ndo you mean, one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon They keep trying\Nto take me to their world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:07:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can resist\Nanymore. You've got to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fight them. I can't, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm just not strong like\Nmy brother, Tai. You're gonna quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.54,0:07:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Harry, I care too much about you\Nto let anyone take you without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will Mary Robertson please\Nreport to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your locker is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're speeding, Harold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By increasing the system memory, I'm\Nexpanding the D-Terminal's capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, do you know how to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be better if we\Ncould communicate in the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not just through e-mail,\Nbut in real-time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be helpful for keeping\Ntabs on the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd rather go\Noutside and play some soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.74,0:08:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go outside and get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place smells like a\Npile of steel sweat socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GK, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:08:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back at the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of lighthouse shines dark light?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way she could\Njust vanish into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got to be in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She probably needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might be in a lot of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might not be in the digi world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, the system can't\Neven pinpoint Kari's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to waste any more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just go and find her on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's the time for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you all stop talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense to open the gate until\Nwe can target Kari's exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world is gigantic, and if\Nwe go in there without any direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're bound to get lost, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not in the digi-world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is creepy, but\Nat least the beach is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must not be the tourist season.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us be your advance bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:10:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a loser, not a fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew there was something wrong with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needed my help, but I'd let her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't leave her by herself,\Nnone of this would have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw her disappearing in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in a different dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this stupid piece of junk is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not even a hot\Ndog stand on this beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's the way out\Nof this stupid world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the news copter may\Nbe another high-speed chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really wish we had more of\Na clue as to where she went.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She kept saying something about the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we'll never find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., don't be such a Sacred cat. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari's one tough kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.48,0:12:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to believe she can take\Ncare of herself until we find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's keep looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is anybody in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Echo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming in here has got to be\Nthe worst idea I have ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I play a lot of soccer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I know how to kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what TK says.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Kari's in the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna save her instead of digging\Nup clams on that stupid sandy beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Kari. Digi-port open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just changed the stupid batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-port, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys don't look so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if we're Digimon,\Nbut I know we're Scubamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have big flippers for\Nswimming deep in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no idea how we got down here or\Nhow long we've been in this awful tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.74,0:13:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day we were serving our undersea\Nmaster, and the next minute we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we feel terrible. This is awful. Who
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would do something like this why not
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to the ocean. I wish that we\Ncould. A dark man came into our master's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kingdom and put these dark spirals on\Nour arms that stole our strength and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:14:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made us all his slaves the digimon\Nemperor that's why we We summoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are very powerful, enough to\Nfree us from the dark spirals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've used the last of our\Nstrength to get you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, help us return to the ocean,\Nwhere we can serve our master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I could\Npossibly do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll do my best, but I\Ndon't know if I'm strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kari, stop doubting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not a quitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody, we've\Ngot to run, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tunnel is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That creature is a servant of the\NDarkwood who put these rings on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sitting ducks here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't fight without my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari! Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he just went crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari! Kari! Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both flip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother would know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The National Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me! Call me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what the heck, I got nine lives. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, promise me we'll\Nnever do that ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, Patamon! There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I'm right\Ndown here. Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to rock, Patamon. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TG Armour Energize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, are you okay? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored! Digi-gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flying home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrraaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spinning needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasus Mod!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too close! Twin Bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.42,0:17:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the armor to achieve out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't have my deed terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know how much\Nlonger they can last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on our tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon, the control spire,\Nyou've got to take it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full blast, Pegasmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Equus beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice shootin', Pegasmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kentarumon, digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digio Ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm calling me the Aqua Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This battle was just a day at the beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, you've got to help them
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call a\Nred-eye reduction Wait a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you guys asked for my help and I\Ngave it to you, now what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt me! Let her go, you creeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with us, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be our new queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trusted you guys and you lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.32,0:19:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we thought you would\Nlove to be our queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:20:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your power, you could lead us in\Nthe battle against our undersea master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess we were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beware, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our master can sense your power, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he will come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could be scraping gum at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last one home is rotten, didn't she, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming after me, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you do the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK, remember this morning when\Nyou said you really cared for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, it was just stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I care for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deshalby. What we're\Nfinding? I'm still there. I
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.54,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't know I'm still there\Nbut I'm still there A
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little bit Tudududududududu\NBecause it's not in
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the morning I'll be watching\Nit Why don't you see it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.58,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.58,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.30,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll open the doors in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll open the doors for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.30,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll open the door for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
